        "content": {
          "format": "source-lines",
          "lines": [
            "1. Kandimei khang gailiangmei Poubaomei Jisu",
            "Tingkao kaguangh bam lou duna rianramei khaeng e",
            "Rianra nimei thai sini",
            "Theih khang tei ping makge Poubaomei Jisu tei.",
            "",
            "Gaipui tingmik gaipui tingmik,",
            "Gaipui tingmik nung Jisu puan e.",
            "",
            "2. Lungsimei banghpui khou rui puan e Jisu tei,",
            "Kandihmei lun kumna ngana suna puanlou the;",
            "Bethlehem kailuangla khou,",
            "Khou tei Poubaomei puan e maansei lun phunga.",
            "",
            "3. Ravguangc rui kanah ndiulouna zau bam e,",
            "Paap bangh nun guay rui kanloumei bam lakhang tei rui,",
            "Bumaeng Thanmei lakhang tei,",
            "Kandihmei paap phunglou khang ndiu keilou the.",
            "",
            "4. Maansei kathuih kaanpatpui bam lakhang cinlou,",
            "Kros rukhou rianra khaenga kazei keilou kan the;",
            "Tarou khou neithumh zipma,",
            "Kapu bam khou bamdat khang tingkao kukan the."
          ]
        }
      }
    },
